                    title:                  `Co-Creating Change`,
                    subtitle:               `Veridian wants you to “train 300 managers.” What they actually need is to dismantle the legacy-P&L resistance stalling their services pivot. You have €840,000 the CFO will not top up, 16 weeks to launch, three sponsors who define success differently, and a cheaper off-the-shelf consultancy waiting to take the mandate. Two years ago you designed a €1.6M academy FOR a client, not WITH them — high satisfaction, no behaviour change, not renewed. Do not repeat it.`,
                    header_tag:             `11 May 2026 · Atelier Cadence, La Rochelle · Veridian Mobilité co-design mandate — 4 weeks to sign or lose it`,
