                    chart_start:            `Start`,
                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (Veridian steering committee — CHRO, COO & CFO; later, the CEO)`,
                    coach_intro:            `Eighteen months of internal change have stalled because middle managers protect the legacy hardware P&L. We did not invite you to run a 300-person academy — we invited you to remove that resistance and build conviction in the services model. The CHRO wants behaviour change, the COO wants a revenue lift, the CFO wants completion and cost under control, and a cheaper consultancy is one signature away. Design WITH us, inside €840k, and prove it worked before our FY27 budget meeting — or this pivot gets shelved.`,

